ic and Nondeterministic Complexity Inclusions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5a23e63a72e2443c\" href=\"?note=5a23e63a72e2443c\" title=\"73-df-binary-p\">73-df-binary-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebe5483ba604bc90\" href=\"?note=ebe5483ba604bc90\" title=\"73-df-binary-np\">73-df-binary-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"79e0c730e7cd49f6\" href=\"?note=79e0c730e7cd49f6\" title=\"73-df-binary-pspace\">73-df-binary-pspace</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7e7069bd8fd38867\" href=\"?note=7e7069bd8fd38867\" title=\"73-df-binary-exptime\">73-df-binary-exptime</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dfb238ddf618b68f\" href=\"?note=dfb238ddf618b68f\" title=\"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy\">73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§11.2–11.3, print pp. 487–501; PDF pp. 509–523; local resource/coding interface"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§12.4 and §13.1, pp. 300–302, 320–324; local asymptotic class notation"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"11"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{NP}\">\\(\\mathsf{NP}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PSPACE}\">\\(\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\\)</span> (binary-language complexity classes)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}standard\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}inclusions}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\subseteq\\mathsf{NP}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}standard\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}inclusions}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\subseteq\\mathsf{NP}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}standard\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}inclusions}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\subsetneq\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}standard\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}inclusions}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\subsetneq\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Deterministic computation is a special case of nondeterminism. A polynomial-time nondeterministic computation tree can be searched in polynomial space, and a halting polynomial-space deterministic machine has at most exponentially many distinct configurations.</li>\n<li>For strictness, every polynomial is eventually bounded by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span>, while the deterministic time hierarchy applied between time-constructible bounds <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^n\">\\(2^n\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{n^2}\">\\(2^{n^2}\\)</span> supplies a language in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\">\\(\\mathsf{EXPTIME}\\)</span> outside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{DTIME}(2^n)\">\\(\\mathsf{DTIME}(2^n)\\)</span>, hence outside <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf P\">\\(\\mathsf P\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-binary-p","status":"resolved","id":"5a23e63a72e2443c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-np","status":"resolved","id":"ebe5483ba604bc90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-pspace","status":"resolved","id":"79e0c730e7cd49f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-pspace]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-binary-exptime","status":"resolved","id":"7e7069bd8fd38867","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-binary-exptime]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"dfb238ddf618b68f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-multitape-time-hierarchy]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{PSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{EXPTIME}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}standard\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}inclusions}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\subseteq\\mathsf{NP}\\subseteq\n\\mathsf{PSPACE}\\subseteq\\mathsf{EXPTIME}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}standard\\text{-}complexity\\text{-}inclusions}\\vdash\n\\mathsf P\\subsetneq\\mathsf{EXPTIME}","display":true},{"tex":"2^n","display":false},{"tex":"2^n","display":false},{"tex":"2^{n^2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\